Joko is our new principal. ___ is very friendly and wise.','He','She','Him','His','A'),(133,5,'This pencil case belongs to me. It is ___.','my','mine','me','myself','B'),(134,5,'Edo and Budi are my best friends. I invited ___ to my house.','they','them','their','theirs','B'),(135,5,'We bought a new ball. That ball is ___.','our','ours','us','we','B'),(136,5,'Dina forgot to bring ___ dictionary to school today.','her','his','its','their','A'),(137,5,'Look at that cat! ___ is climbing the tall mango tree.','He','She','It','They','C'),(138,5,'You and I have the same score. ___ should celebrate together.','They','We','Us','Them','B'),(139,5,'Can you help ___, please? I cannot lift this heavy table alone.','I','me','my','mine','B'),(140,5,'Rian has a new motorcycle. ___ always washes it on Sunday morning.','He','Him','His','They','A'),(141,5,'The students cleaned ___ classroom before the bell rang.','their','them','theirs','they','A'),(142,5,'Which word is an OBJECT PRONOUN?','She','Him','We','They','B'),(143,5,'My brother gave this book to ___.','I','me','my','mine','B'),(144,5,'That bag belongs to Tina. It is ___ bag.','his','her','its','their','B'),(145,5,'Which pronoun replaces \"Budi and Andi\"?','He','They','We','She','B'),(146,6,'What is the written English word for number \"44\"?','Forty-four','Fourty-four','Fourteen-four','Forty-fourth','A'),(147,6,'Budi won the race and got the ___ prize.','one','first','two','secondly','B'),(148,6,'How do you write \"3rd\" in full English words?','Three','Thirteen','Third','Thirty','C'),(149,6,'What is 50 plus 25?','Seventy','Seventy-five','Sixty-five','Eighty-five','B'),(150,6,'Which of the following is a CARDINAL number?','First','Second','Twenty-one','Twentieth','C'),(151,6,'My classroom is on the ___ floor of the main building.','two','second','twice','twenty','B'),(152,6,'How do you spell the number \"90\"?','Nineteen','Ninty','Ninety','Ninth','C'),(153,6,'Today is the ___ day of the month.','ten','tenth','tenthy','teens'